{"id":"7c5b6524602a5a39","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/828_Basic_Logic_BL.md","title":"828 Basic Logic BL","display":"828_Basic_Logic_BL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。Basic Logic 语言构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\quad \\&amp;,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot,\\quad \\&amp;,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span> 是派生记号。无绑定构造子。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>构造子类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,(A\\&amp;B),(A\\to B),(A\\wedge B),(A\\vee B)\">\\(p,\\bot,(A\\&amp;B),(A\\to B),(A\\wedge B),(A\\vee B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元出现与替换\">3. 变元出现与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^{\\mathsf{Prop}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^{\\mathsf{Prop}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span>，记\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\sigma)\\)</span>，则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{fus}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{fus}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由变量别名与替换函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>绑定排除条款：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}),\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{Basic}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(A)=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}),\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{Basic}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 不需要 fresh 选择或捕获避免重命名；替换函数由上述逐构造子子句给出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-BL-代数结构\">4. BL-代数结构</h1>\n<p>BL-代数为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A=(A,\\le,0,1,*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf A=(A,\\le,0,1,*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足下列全部条件。各分量类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\le\\;\\subseteq A^2,\n\\quad\n0,1\\in A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\ne\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\le\\;\\subseteq A^2,\n\\quad\n0,1\\in A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee:A^2\\to A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee:A^2\\to A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上偏序：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le a,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le a)\\Rightarrow a=b,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le c)\\Rightarrow a\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le a,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le a)\\Rightarrow a=b,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le c)\\Rightarrow a\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\le,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee)\">\\((A,\\le,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee)\\)</span> 是有界格，展开为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad\na\\vee b=b\\vee a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad\na\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\quad\na\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\quad\na\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,*,1)\">\\((A,*,1)\\)</span> 是交换幺半群，展开为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b=b*a,\\qquad\n(a*b)*c=a*(b*c),\\qquad\na*1=1*a=a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b=b*a,\\qquad\n(a*b)*c=a*(b*c),\\qquad\na*1=1*a=a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>剩余运算满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b\\le c\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\na\\le b\\Rightarrow c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b\\le c\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\na\\le b\\Rightarrow c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>预线性成立：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\Rightarrow b)\\vee(b\\Rightarrow a)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\Rightarrow b)\\vee(b\\Rightarrow a)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可除性成立：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=a*(a\\Rightarrow b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b=a*(a\\Rightarrow b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异是 Hájek Basic Logic 的代数语义同时包含预线性与可除性：只保留预线性会得到较弱的 MTL 代数条件，只保留交换整剩余格核心也不足以刻画 BL。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-赋值递归\">5. 赋值递归</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 为所有上述 BL-代数之类。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span>，赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\)</span> 的解释为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\mathbf A)=A^{\\mathsf{Prop}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\mathbf A)=A^{\\mathsf{Prop}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=v(p),\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{bot}\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=v(p),\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{bot}\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}*\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}*\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\wedge\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\wedge\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\vee\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\vee\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-语义有效集合与后承\">6. 语义有效集合与后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\,\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to A\\,\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{Basic}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{Basic}}A\\)</span> 当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span>，且对所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>反例证书类定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf A,v):\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\\nv\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\mathbf A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf A,v):\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\\\nv\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\mathbf A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1,\n\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\ne1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}=1,\n\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf A,v}^{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\ne1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\varnothing\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\\varnothing\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不定义证明对象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>Basic Logic 为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 仅由本条目完全展开的 BL-代数结构、赋值递归、指定值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}\\)</span> 定义；预线性与可除性是结构定义的显式组成部分。</p>\n<p>该系统只含命题句法、命题替换、BL-代数语义、语义有效集合和后承关系；不含 IMTL、SMTL 的额外方程或证明对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元出现与替换","text":"3. 变元出现与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-BL-代数结构","text":"4. BL-代数结构","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值递归","text":"5. 赋值递归","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义有效集合与后承","text":"6. 语义有效集合与后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\quad \\&,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{Basic}}","display":fals